      "page": 1,
      "text": "VT-86\nCDR J. V. Seida SABREHAWKS CDR A. M. Farina\nCOMMANDING OFFICER EXECUTIVE OFFICER\nNAS PENSACOLA, FL\n\"TRAINING NFOs FOR THE WORLD\"\nWednesday, 25-Nov-2026\nSUNRISE: 0623 MOONRISE: 1748 % ILLUM: 99% JULIAN DATE: 6329\nSUNSET: 1649 MOONSET: 0741\nTOTAL FLY EVENTS: 0 TOTAL FLY HRS: 0.0 SYL FLY EVENTS: 0 SYL FLY HRS: 0.0\nTOTAL SIM EVENTS: 1 TOTAL SIM HRS: 1.0 SYL SIM EVENTS: 0 SYL SIM HRS: 0.0\nCOMMANDER\u2019S COMMENTS:\nALL HANDS SAFETY DAY / AOM 0800-1000\nCDO AND SDO SHALL BE AVAILABLE FOR RECALL TO THE SQUADRON\nDUTY/WATCH ASSIGNED AVAILABLE\nCDO BANKO A ALL DAY\nSDO Dennis J ALL DAY\nFUTURE OPS:\nDECEMBER 10: IGS\nDECEMBER 11: HOLIDAY PARTY\nDECEMBER 17: IGS\nSCHEDULE NOTES:\nALL HANDS SHALL PT EVERY WORKDAY IAW OPNAVINST 6110.0L\nUNDERLINED NAMES INDICATE CREW DAY >9 HRS ITALICIZED NAMES INDICATE STUDENTS SCHEDULED FOR TWO GRADED EVENTS\nAVN 4101/4102 AUTHORIZED FOR BACKUP EVENTS\n1. OUT/IN FLIGHTS\n2. OPTIONAL WARMUP\n3. VMTS A/C REQUIRED\n4. COMPLETE STAN EXAM PRIOR TO FLIGHT (INSTRUCTOR ONLY)\n5. STUDENT COMPLETION EVENT\n6. BLUES PRACTICE 1030-1130 NO TAXI AFTER 1015\n7. LL/BFM\n8. LOG A MINIMUM OF 1 HRS OF NIGHT TIME FOR STUDENT/PILOT\n9. INSTRUCTOR IAE REQUIRED\n10. INSTRUCTOR FINI FLIGHT\nT-45C SIMULATOR SCHEDULE"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "BRIEF SCHD SIM INSTRUCTOR STUDENT EVENT REMARKS\nTIME T/O\n0630 1 FREEPLAY\n0830 1 FREEPLAY\n1030 1 THOMPSON B PITTMAN C Practice VIP TOUR\nSim\n1230 1 FREEPLAY\n1430 1 FREEPLAY\n1700 1 FREEPLAY\n0630 2 FREEPLAY\n0830 2 FREEPLAY\n1030 2 FREEPLAY\n1230 2 FREEPLAY\n1430 2 FREEPLAY\n1700 2 FREEPLAY\n0630 3 FREEPLAY\n0830 3 FREEPLAY\n1030 3 FREEPLAY\n1230 3 FREEPLAY\n1430 3 FREEPLAY\n1700 3 FREEPLAY\n0630 4 FREEPLAY\n0830 4 FREEPLAY\n1030 4 FREEPLAY\n1230 4 FREEPLAY\n1430 4 FREEPLAY\n1700 4 FREEPLAY\nGROUND EVENTS\nTIME EVENT LOCATION PERSON INSTRUCTOR REMARKS\nCAI\n0800-0900 NAV0101 Horn W, Ptaszek M, Shaw B, Schaap D Introduction To ICAO\n0800-1130 AWI1201 Batiste L, Gessner E, Haslam P, Monson M 1v1 AWI Procedures I\n0900-1100 NAV0102 Horn W, Ptaszek M, Shaw B, Schaap D Instrument Publications,\nProcedures & Flight Planning 1\n(FAA)\n1100-1300 NAV0103 Horn W, Ptaszek M, Shaw B, Schaap D Instrument Publications,\nProcedures, & Flight Planning 2"
